      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِسْلَامُ</span></b>  [inf. n. of 4, q. v. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  It is the general
term for <i>The religion of Mohammad:</i> differing
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِيمَانُ</span>, as shown above: see 4. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
hence, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَهْلُ الإِسْلَامِ</span>, or the like,] <i>The Muslims,
collectively.</i> (M in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بيض</span>, &amp;c.)

